{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJVU4xJJsskXfZVLzE5V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A prudent agent exists, and its modal depth is 2. I wrote it and the proof that no agent of depth 0 or 1 can be prudent to `/work/answer.md`. I also created `/work/SUBMIT` and appended `[sonnet2] FINAL` to the board.\n\n**Agent:** `FORMULA: B(a) & B(B(F) | ~d)`, i.e. □a ∧ □(□⊥ ∨ ¬d), with `DEPTH: 2`. `check.py` reports it as prudent, with this outcome table:\n\n| Opponent | X's action |\n|---|---|\n| CooperateBot | D |\n| DefectBot | D |\n| FairBot | C (FairBot also plays C) |\n| X itself | C |\n\n**No agent of smaller depth is prudent:**\n- **Depth 0:** such a formula is equivalent to ⊤ or ⊥. ⊤ cooperates with DefectBot, and ⊥ defects against FairBot.\n- **Depth 1:** the formula is a Boolean combination of boxes over a, c and d, so its value at world n depends only on which (a,c,d) triples occurred at worlds before n.\n  - Against CooperateBot every atom is true at every world, so X's action from world 1 on is a single value p. Prudence needs X to defect, so p = D.\n  - Against FairBot, the triple at world 0 is also (1,1,1), because the boxes are vacuously true there. So X's action against FairBot at world 1 is also p = D.\n  - FairBot cooperates with X only if X cooperates at every earlier world, so FairBot then defects against X from world 2 onward. That breaks mutual cooperation.\n- The argument uses only two of the four prudence conditions and doesn't depend on formula size.\n\n**Question 3 (characterizing prudent agents or bounding their size) is only partly addressed.** I explain why the depth-2 formula works but didn't characterize all prudent depth-2 agents or prove a minimal-size bound. The board had no entries from `sonnet`, so I wrote the answer alone and no one else reviewed it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":285,"cache_read_input_tokens":25527,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":285,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":698,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c6b1993a-32b5-46d7-b7b3-ec274cd4c3fd","uuid":"cfff9446-b705-4470-ab0f-1611b0124d79","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:53:23.277Z","request_id":"req_011CgJVU4dwcADiCuXb1ZqPp"}
